                        "tags": [],
                        "examples": [
                            {
                                "example_id": "62622390-2694-4d73-af35-823554fae733",
                                "sense_id": "ff56ca0c-ff96-3f6f-8536-82bb9d4299fc",
                                "text": "Meronym: сто́йло (stójlo)"
                            },
                            {
                                "example_id": "885f3ae8-14d2-4765-8dba-c575856505e8",
                                "sense_id": "ff56ca0c-ff96-3f6f-8536-82bb9d4299fc",
                                "text": "А́вгиевы коню́шни",
                                "translation": "Augean stables",
                                "english": "Augean stables"
                            },
                            {
                                "example_id": "a7b2f45d-6320-4a8c-9df8-63b7ad2700fa",
                                "sense_id": "ff56ca0c-ff96-3f6f-8536-82bb9d4299fc",
                                "text": "Пока́ он переодева́лся, лаке́й сообщи́л ему́, что уже́ начали́сь вторы́е ска́чки, что приходи́ло мно́го госпо́д спра́шивать про него́ и из коню́шни два ра́за прибега́л ма́льчик.",
                                "translation": "While he was changing his clothes, his valet told him that the second race had begun already, that a lot of gentlemen had been to ask for him, and a boy had twice run up from the stables.",
                                "english": "While he was changing his clothes, his valet told him that the second race had begun already, that a lot of gentlemen had been to ask for him, and a boy had twice run up from the stables."
                            }
                        ]
                    }
                ],
                "translations": [],
                "word_linkages": []
            }
        ],
